node_modules/
# Per-unit bun.lock files are COMMITTED (de-workspaced 5ae): each TS unit
# (packages/rpc, services/web-ui-ssr, tooling) owns its own lockfile, and
# committing them makes the nix node_modules FODs PURE (no --impure / $PWD
# read). Do NOT re-add a `bun.lock` ignore.

# Generated protobuf/connect-es code
packages/rpc/gen/

# Java service: buf-generated sources + Maven build output
services/business-logic-java/generated-sources/
services/business-logic-java/target/

# Java reactor modules: Maven build output
packages/java/*/target/

